[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "startSeconds": 0.0,
    "endSeconds": 12.21,
    "text": "One morning — and the baobab would remember this morning for the rest of its very long life — the Creator reached down from the sky and pulled the baobab out of the ground.",
    "charStart": 0,
    "charEnd": 172
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "startSeconds": 12.21,
    "endSeconds": 14.82,
    "text": "The baobab was surprised.",
    "charStart": 174,
    "charEnd": 199
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "startSeconds": 14.82,
    "endSeconds": 18.62,
    "text": "No tree had ever been pulled out of the ground before.",
    "charStart": 200,
    "charEnd": 254
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "startSeconds": 18.62,
    "endSeconds": 20.63,
    "text": "What— it began.",
    "charStart": 256,
    "charEnd": 271
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "startSeconds": 20.63,
    "endSeconds": 23.56,
    "text": "The Creator turned it upside down.",
    "charStart": 273,
    "charEnd": 307
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "startSeconds": 23.56,
    "endSeconds": 25.92,
    "text": "And planted it again.",
    "charStart": 309,
    "charEnd": 330
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "startSeconds": 25.92,
    "endSeconds": 29.5,
    "text": "Roots in the air.",
    "charStart": 332,
    "charEnd": 349
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "startSeconds": 29.5,
    "endSeconds": 31.47,
    "text": "Branches in the earth.",
    "charStart": 350,
    "charEnd": 372
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "startSeconds": 31.47,
    "endSeconds": 34.69,
    "text": "There, said the Creator.",
    "charStart": 374,
    "charEnd": 398
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "startSeconds": 34.69,
    "endSeconds": 36.59,
    "text": "Let us see how you feel about your appearance now.",
    "charStart": 399,
    "charEnd": 449
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "startSeconds": 36.59,
    "endSeconds": 39.98,
    "text": "The baobab stood — if standing is the right word for what it was now doing — in stunned silence.",
    "charStart": 451,
    "charEnd": 547
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "startSeconds": 39.98,
    "endSeconds": 54.83,
    "text": "Its roots, which had previously done the useful work of drinking water and holding the earth, now stretched up into the sky like the frantic arms of someone who has just remembered something urgent.",
    "charStart": 549,
    "charEnd": 747
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "startSeconds": 54.83,
    "endSeconds": 65.01,
    "text": "Its branches, which had previously held leaves and flowers and fruit for all to admire, were buried underground, pressing into the dark.",
    "charStart": 748,
    "charEnd": 884
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "startSeconds": 65.01,
    "endSeconds": 70.75,
    "text": "It was, without any question at all, the strangest-looking thing in the world.",
    "charStart": 886,
    "charEnd": 964
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "startSeconds": 70.75,
    "endSeconds": 74.85,
    "text": "And the baobab had no one to blame but itself.",
    "charStart": 966,
    "charEnd": 1012
  }
]